<title>CHINA: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on conglomerates.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on conglomerates.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W I Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Wednesday it issued 150 million American style call warrants on a basket of conglomerates stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> Hongkong Land Holdings Ltd	  0.193 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd     0.082 shares</p>
<p> Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd	  0.057 shares</p>
<p> Hutchison Whampoa Ltd		 0.063 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$18.612    PREMIUM	12.45 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.465     GEARING	4.45x</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$20.68     BOARD LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   06.AUG.98</p>
<p> ISSUE DATE	   06.AUG.97</p>
<p> NOTE		   CASH OR PHYSICAL AT THE OPTION OF THE ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
